It's the emphasis on hindsight, the benefit of hindsight and the fact that as bleak and as negative as things may seem in the moment, actually it may be building to something better.
它强调事后诸葛亮，事后诸葛亮的好处，以及这样一个事实：尽管目前的情况看起来很黯淡和消极，但实际上它可能正在走向更好的方向。

