so and actually seriously thank you for that it's really helped thinking about it and watching the program I don't think you can be emphasised just how much it means to people and how much it means to me I don't know how to thank you for that except for this message Well, hello there, I'm Josh Ratner, I am joined by my friend Craig Thomas for another episode of How We Made Your Mother, Hi Craig.
所以，实际上，我真的很感谢你，因为它对思考这个问题和观看这个节目确实有帮助，我认为你无法强调它对人们的意义有多大，对我的意义有多大。除了这条消息，我不知道如何感谢你。好吧，你好，我是乔什·拉特纳，我和我的朋友克雷格·托马斯一起观看了《我们如何创造了你的母亲》的另一集，嗨克雷格。

