这就是该剧令人向往的品质。

00:06:20.017 --> 00:06:34.795
It seems at first that it's the aspiration of meeting the one, but in a way it's also just surviving and telling, realizing you're becoming the person who's going to tell this story one day, which I loved head for because that's his drive.
乍一看，这似乎是与那个人见面的愿望，但在某种程度上，这也只是生存和讲述，意识到你有一天会成为讲述这个故事的人，我喜欢走向这个，因为这是他的动力。

